{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2077"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge music-stage/pop-rock","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/music-stage__pop-rock.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",827],["+"," A year after Pharrell's triumph a debut proved the point again: Meghan Trainor, a 20-year-old songwriter from Nantucket, Massachusetts, released **All About That Bass** in 2014, a doo-wop-flavoured body-positivity anthem whose pastel-coloured video raced around social media; the song spent eight weeks at number one in the United States."],["=",202],["+","\n| All About That Bass | Meghan Trainor | 2014 | pastel video, eight weeks at US number one |"],["=",54]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",769],["+"," Ein Jahr nach Pharrells Triumph bewies ein Debüt es erneut: Meghan Trainor, eine 20-jährige Songwriterin aus Nantucket in Massachusetts, veröffentlichte 2014 **All About That Bass**, eine Doo-Wop-gefärbte Hymne auf die Körperakzeptanz, deren pastellfarbenes Video durch die sozialen Medien raste; der Song stand acht Wochen lang auf Platz eins in den USA."],["=",202],["+","\n| All About That Bass | Meghan Trainor | 2014 | Pastell-Video, acht Wochen auf Platz eins in den USA |"],["=",44]]}]},
